{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28726","headline":"行次白沙馆先寄上河南王侍郎 · 杜牧","name":"行次白沙馆先寄上河南王侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜程何处宿，山叠树层层。\n孤馆闲秋雨，空堂停曙灯。\n歌慙渔浦客，诗学雁门僧。\n此意无人识，明朝见李膺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}